      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable and attentive store assistants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most customers praise the staff for their patient guidance, deep knowledge of reptile husbandry, and helpful advice for beginners. Reviewers appreciate team members who take time to answer questions about habitats and diet. While a few visitors experienced dismissive or rude service from certain employees, the staff is generally described as accommodating."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Diverse and well-kept exotic pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors consistently remark on the wide variety of healthy reptiles, amphibians, and invertebrates available throughout the shop. Clients praise the well-fed condition and lively temperament of ball pythons, bearded dragons, and skinks. Reviewers frequently note that habitat enclosures appear clean and properly maintained for the animals on display."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Specialised habitats and terrarium setups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Hobbyists appreciate the extensive inventory of terrariums, feeder insects, bioactive substrates, and live plants on site. Customers describe the store as an engaging destination for reptile enthusiasts seeking niche equipment. While one reviewer felt the interior was somewhat run-down and another experienced a cracked tank, most visitors praise the product selection."
      }
    }
  ],
