    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the shop stock live feeder insects and food?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers regularly purchase crickets, fruit fly cultures, worms, and other live feeders."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can beginner reptile keepers get guidance on care setups?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, staff members provide advice on terrarium equipment, heating, lighting, and suitable starter pets."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are custom bioactive terrarium enclosures available?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the shop supplies bioactive terrarium components, substrate mixes, live plants, and display setups."
